+- [[metals/cadmium]]
+- [[metals/chromium]]
+- [[metals/nickel]]
+- [[metals/copper]]
+- [[metals/zinc]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+The PDF title, authors, DOI, journal, year, license, methods, and Table 1 values were read from the auto-fetched PDF. The source measures total chromium and total metal concentrations in beeswax; it does not provide chromium speciation, arsenic, mercury, or honey-as-food values.

