+| 1 | Beekeeper 1, Kumanovo | 0.042 | 0.040 | nd | 1.152 | 0.071 | 2.133 | 0.113 | 0.080 | nd | 0.005 | nd |
+| 2 | Beekeeper, Skopje | 0.039 | nd | nd | 2.498 | 0.171 | 3.474 | 0.348 | nd | nd | 0.019 | nd |
